      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_da5ff883",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: donaldtrump_2020; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes a photo of Donald Trump with a photo of Ilhan Omar, placing her in a jail cell while falsely claiming she broke federal tax law by filing jointly with a man she was not legally married to. This visual and textual combination is intended to discredit and demean Ilhan Omar, a Black Muslim woman, by associating her with criminal behavior and using her image in a degrading context. The meme leverages racial and religious stereotypes by implying that her actions are morally or legally questionable, and it uses the imagery of imprisonment to suggest she is a criminal, which is a hateful attack based on her identity as a Black Muslim woman.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6692431e"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
