      "description": "A meme scene composed of three vertically stacked visual elements: Donald Trump speaking at a podium, a portrait of Ilhan Omar, and an image of a jail cell. The scene is framed by text overlays that falsely accuse Ilhan Omar of tax fraud and depict her in a prison setting, creating a juxtaposition intended to discredit her. The spatial arrangement is vertical, with each visual element occupying a distinct section of the image, and the text overlays are positioned to directly relate to each visual component.",
