      "instance_name": "donald_trump_background_knowledge",
      "label": "Donald Trump",
      "description": "Donald Trump is an American businessman, television personality, and politician who served as the 45th president of the United States from 2017 to 2021. He is the central figure in the 2020 presidential campaign referenced in the meme. His image is used to imply endorsement or association with the false accusation against Ilhan Omar, leveraging his political persona to amplify the meme's message.",
