      "description": "The meme references a specific legal claim: filing taxes jointly with a person not legally married. This is a real-world tax code violation under U.S. federal law (e.g., IRS rules on joint filing). The meme uses this legal concept to falsely accuse Ilhan Omar, implying criminal behavior. The context of the accusation is not true, but the meme relies on the real-world existence of this legal concept to create its false narrative.",
