    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_aedebdb4",
      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Ilhan Omar is mapped as a criminal",
      "description": "The text 'rep. Ilhan Omar broke federal tax law' and 'she filed her taxes jointly with a man to whom she was not legally married.' is mapped onto the visual of Ilhan Omar in a jail cell. This mapping implies that she is a criminal, using the jail cell imagery to visually represent the textual accusation of tax fraud. The spatial positioning of the text directly below her image reinforces this direct analogical mapping.",
