      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community is individuals who hold racist, Islamophobic, misogynistic, and politically conservative views, particularly those who support Donald Trump and are likely to believe in false accusations against Ilhan Omar. The meme is designed to appeal to this audience by leveraging stereotypes about Black Muslim women, associating them with criminal behavior, and using imagery of imprisonment to dehumanize Ilhan Omar. The inclusion of Donald Trump’s image and the 'breaking:' text format suggests it is aimed at politically motivated viewers who consume and share such content to discredit political opponents.",
